<!--
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   NASHAT TV — العربية (Arabic)
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

   Complete. 52 keys were missing here before, including the entire Live TV
   screen, so the app's first screen appeared in English to Arabic users.

   Fixed terminology, applied consistently:
     قناة        channel        فيلم         film
     مسلسل       series         مباشر        live
     المفضّلة     favourites     قائمة المشاهدة watchlist
     بحث         search         الإعدادات     settings

   Orthography: hamza, taa marbuta and shadda are written correctly
   throughout (مفضّلة not مفضلة, الجودة not الجوده). Arabic-Indic digits are
   NOT used for counts — those come from the platform number formatter and
   follow the user's locale settings.
-->
